[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    The LCM is found by taking the highest power of each prime that appears in the factorizations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    - The highest power of 2 is \(2^2\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    - The highest power of 3 is \(3^1\).
