[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 1. **Definition of Cotangent:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    The cotangent of an angle \(\theta\) is defined as the ratio of the cosine of \(\theta\) to the sine of \(\theta\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \cot \theta = \frac{\cos \theta}{\sin \theta}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 2. **Values of Trigonometric Functions at \(90^\circ\):**
