[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \cos 90^\circ = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 3. **Substitute the Values:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    Substitute \(\theta = 90^\circ\) into the cotangent definition:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \cot 90^\circ = \frac{\cos 90^\circ}{\sin 90^\circ} = \frac{0}{1} = 0
