[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m - \( r = 4.5\% = 0.045 \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m - \( n = 1 \) (since the interest is compounded annually)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m - \( t = 2 \) years
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Substitute the given values into the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
