[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ \text{Interest} = 10,920.25 - 10,000 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ \text{Interest} = 920.25 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
