[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Therefore, the probability of winning before the fourth turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
