[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Applying Vieta's formulas to $p(x) = x^2 + ax + b$, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 1. The sum of the roots $2a + b = -a$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 2. The product of the roots $2a \cdot b = b$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m From the first equation, we can solve for $b$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[2a + b = -a \implies 3a + b = 0 \implies b = -3a\]
