[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Now, we have
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[\sqrt[3]{2} - 1 = \cfrac{1}{b + \cfrac{1}{c + \cfrac{1}{d + \dotsb}}}.\]
