[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m First, calculate the total amount after 2 years:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[A = 10000(1 + 0.045)^2 = 10000(1.045)^2 = 10000 \times 1.092025 = 10920.25\]
