[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m The interest earned is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ A - P = 10920.25 - 10000 = 920.25 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
