[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ \binom{11}{3} = \frac{11!}{3!(11-3)!} = \frac{11 \times 10 \times 9}{3 \times 2 \times 1} = 165 \]
