[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m The mean of these three integers is \(n\), and according to the problem, the product divided by the mean is 24:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
