[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 1. **Inner Function Analysis:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    - The function \( \sin x \) ranges from \( 0 \) to \( 1 \) in the interval \( 0^\circ < x < 180^\circ \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    - However, since \( \sqrt{\sin x} \) is inside a logarithm, \( \sin x \) cannot be \( 0 \). Therefore, \( \sin x \) ranges from \( 0 \) (exclusive) to \( 1 \) (inclusive).
