[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 2. **Transformation by Square Root:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    - The square root function \( \sqrt{\sin x} \) will then range from \( 0 \) (exclusive) to \( 1 \) (inclusive).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
