[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ (n-1)n(n+1) = 120 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m The mean of these integers is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ \frac{(n-1) + n + (n+1)}{3} = n \]
