[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ n = 5 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m So, the largest of the three consecutive integers is \( n+1 = 6 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Therefore, the answer is \boxed{6}.
