[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ x = -3 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ x = 2 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m These are the points where the vertical asymptotes occur. Therefore, the function has 2 vertical asymptotes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m The final answer is \(\boxed{2}\).
