[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m [response] To find the value of \(\left(16\sqrt[3]{a^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}\) when \(a = 8\), we can follow these steps:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 1. Substitute \(a = 8\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 2. Simplify inside the cube root:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    8^2 = 64 \quad \text{and} \quad \sqrt[3]{64} = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \left(16 \cdot 4\right)^{\frac{1}{3}} = 64^{\frac{1}{3}}
