[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ A = \sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)} = \sqrt{21(21-12)(21-14)(21-16)} = \sqrt{21 \times 9 \times 7 \times 5} = \sqrt{6930} = 84 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Now, substitute \( A \) and \( s \) into the formula for the radius:
