[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m - \(r = 0.045\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m - \(n = 1\) (since the interest is compounded annually)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m - \(t = 2\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
