[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m n^2 = 25
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m n = 5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Thus, the largest of the three consecutive integers is \(n+1 = 6\). Therefore, the answer is \(\boxed{6}\).
