[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ A = \sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)} = \sqrt{21 \cdot (21-12) \cdot (21-14) \cdot (21-16)} = \sqrt{21 \cdot 9 \cdot 7 \cdot 5} = \sqrt{6930} = 21\sqrt{15} \]
