[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[(x+2)^2 + (y-5)^2 + (z+1)^2 - 25 = 0,\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m or
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[(x+2)^2 + (y-5)^2 + (z+1)^2 = 25.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m This is the standard form of the equation of a sphere with center \((-2, 5, -1)\) and radius 5. Therefore, the center of the sphere is \(\boxed{(-2, 5, -1)}\).
