[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Next, we consider the expression inside the logarithm, \( \sqrt{\sin x} \). Since \( 0 < \sin x \leq 1 \), it follows that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ 0 < \sqrt{\sin x} \leq 1. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Now, we apply the logarithm base 2 to this range:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ \log_2 (\sqrt{\sin x}) = \log_2 ((\sin x)^{1/2}) = \frac{1}{2} \log_2 (\sin x). \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
