[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 2. The product of the roots is equal to the constant term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    2a \cdot b = b
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m    If \( b \neq 0 \), we can divide both sides by \( b \):
