[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ T(b+1) - T(b) = \frac{(b+1)(b+2)}{2} - \frac{b(b+1)}{2} = \frac{(b+1)(b+2 - b)}{2} = b + 1. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m We need this difference to be a triangular number, i.e., there exists a positive integer \( x \) such that:
