[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Thus, the probability that the game will be won before the fourth turn is \(\boxed{\frac{91}{216}}\).
