[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m We can rewrite the sequence \(B\) as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[B = 2^5, 2^3, 2^1, 2^{-1}, 2^{-3}, \ldots\]
