[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m The minimum value of \(\cos \theta\) is \(-1\), which occurs when \(\theta = \pi\) (i.e., the vectors are in opposite directions). Therefore, the minimum value of \(\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w}\) is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 12 \cdot (-1) = -12
