[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m The denominator is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ x^2 + x - 6 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Factoring the quadratic expression, we get:
