[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Setting each factor equal to zero gives us the roots:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ x + 3 = 0 \quad \text{or} \quad x - 2 = 0 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ x = -3 \quad \text{or} \quad x = 2 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m These roots indicate that there are vertical asymptotes at \( x = -3 \) and \( x = 2 \). Therefore, the graph of the function has \(\boxed{2}\) vertical asymptotes.
