[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m The perimeter of one of these triangles is the sum of its three sides:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
