[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Thus, the perimeter of one of these triangles is \(\boxed{14 + 7\sqrt{2}}\).
