[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m [response] To find the value of \(\left(16\sqrt[3]{a^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}\) when \(a = 8\), we can proceed as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m First, substitute \(a = 8\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Since \(8 = 2^3\), we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 8^2 = (2^3)^2 = 2^6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Thus,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \sqrt[3]{8^2} = \sqrt[3]{2^6} = 2^2 = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Now substitute back:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \left(16 \cdot 4\right)^{\frac{1}{3}} = \left(64\right)^{\frac{1}{3}} = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m So, the value is \(\boxed{4}\).
