[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ x^2 - 8x + 16 = 11 - 2x \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m Rearranging all terms to one side of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
