[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m This quadratic equation can be factored as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ (x - 1)(x - 5) = 0 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m So, the potential solutions are:
