[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m The inequality \( f(x) + f(y) \leq 0 \) becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ (x+3)^2 - 8 + (y+3)^2 - 8 \leq 0 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m \[ (x+3)^2 + (y+3)^2 \leq 16 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2111625)[0m This represents a circle centered at \( (-3, -3) \) with radius 4.
